          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માર્ગ — mārg — \"a route; a way (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શહેરમાં જવાનો સૌથી ટૂંકો માર્ગ કયો છે? śahermā̃ javāno sauthī ṭū̃ko mārg kayo che? What is the shortest route into the city?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માર્ગ (mārg) is a tatsama, Sanskrit mārga, first the track of a wild animal and then any road or way (Monier-Williams); signs and books use it where speech says રસ્તો."
            }
          ]
        },
