          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દોરવું (dorvũ) goes back to dōr, \"to look at or for\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to direct\" (CDIAL 6581). It also means to draw a line, a sense this lesson leaves for later."
            }
